<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Iƹibraniyen</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iƹb</para>
  <para style="toc2">Iƹibraniyen</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat ɣar iƹibraniyen</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat ɣar iƹibraniyen</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Siḏi Arebbi issawaȓ akiḏneɣ s Mmis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Ḏi zman issawaȓ Arebbi ak ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ s uqemmum n lʼanbiya s waṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin s waṭṭas n ibriḏen. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />Walakin ḏi lʼayyam-a ineggura issawaȓ akiḏneɣ s uqemmum n Mmis iƹni wenni iy ixḍar aḏ iwareṯ marra ṯimesȓayin, zzayes iy d ixȓeq Arebbi ddunect. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Netta ḏ nnur n lƹaḍama n Arebbi ḏ ṣṣifeṯ n ṭṭabiƹa nnes bȓa axeṭṭi. S jjheḏ n wawaȓ nnes iy zi irebbu marra ṯimesȓayin. Wami iḥell ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n bnaḏem issiṣfa-ṯent, ssenni iqqim x ufusi n Arebbi Subḥana wa Tƹala.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹaḍama n Mmis n Arebbi x lmalaʼikaṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Fa Mmis iḏweȓ imɣar aṭṭas x lmalaʼikaṯ minzi isem nni iy ḏas iswareṯ Arebbi imɣar aṭṭas x yisemawen nsent.<verse eid="HEB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Arebbi ƹemmarṣ war ḏas yinni i can n lmalak zi lmalaʼikaṯ aqa cek ḏ Mmi, nhara nec ḏewȓeɣ ḏ Babac.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 1:5">Ƹemmarṣ war yinni <char style="it">x can n lmalak</char> qa nec aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ Babas, netta aḏ yiȓi ḏ Mmi.<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />U ƹaweḏ Arebbi wami d itawi Mmis amenzu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amenzu netta ḏ ifxeddi, qqaren-ṯ i uḥenjir iy d ɣa ixeȓqen ḏ amezwaru.</char></note> ɣar ddunect-a iqqar: Aḏas sejjḏent marra lmalaʼikaṯ.<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Xmi issawaȓ x lmalaʼikaṯ iqqar:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">&lt;Ixeǧeq-d lmalaʼikaṯ nnes ḏ arriḥ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">ḏ imsexxaren nnes ḏ aḥaḏuq n ṯmessi.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Walakin x Mmis iqqar <char style="it">ḏi Lkitab</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:8">&lt;Ay Arebbi, ȓƹarc nnec aḏ idum i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">ȓḥaqq aḏ yiȓi ḏ ṯaɣriṯ n ȓeḥkam nnec.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Tḥibbiḏ min iṣeȓḥen, tƹiffiḏ ccarr.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">S manaya Arebbi iƹni Arebbi nnec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:9">iḏhen-ac s zzect n ȓefraḥeṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">isiȓi-yic ḏeg ujenna x imƹacaren nnec.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Iqqar ƹaweḏ: &lt;Ay Arebbi, ḏeg umezwaru ṯserseḏ dsasaṯ n ddunect-a, ṯeggiḏ ijennaṯen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijennaṯen niṯni ḏ ljamaƹ n ujenna, iƹni ḏ ssmawaṯ.</char></note> s ufus nnec.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Yina aḏ fnan cek aḏ tdumeḏ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:11">marra aḏ rcan am warruḍ.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Aṯen ṯḍefseḏ am uzeǧab ḏ axarṭiṭ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">aḏ twabeddȓen am warruḍ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 1:12">Cek lla, war tbeddiȓeḏ ca,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">iseggwusa nnec ƹemmarṣ aḏ fnan.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Iwa ƹemmarṣ Arebbi war yinni i can n lmalak zi lmalaʼikaṯ: &lt;Qqim-d x ufusi inu aȓ d ɣa ggeɣ ȓƹaḏyan nnec swadday iḍaren nnec.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Lmalaʼikaṯ, niṯenti min ƹnant? Niṯenti ḏ arruḥaṯ twassekkent-id aḏ sexxarent i yinni iy ɣa iwarṯen asenjem.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Asenjem nneɣ imɣaren aṭṭas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />X manaya labud a d narr ȓbaȓ nneɣ i min netsȓa bac war nteffeɣ ca abriḏ. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Cuf, <char style="it">Ccariƹa nni n Musa</char> tuɣa uwint-tid lmalaʼikaṯ, tseyṭar xaneɣ tƹaqab-aneɣ iƹni meȓa neƹṣa niɣ meȓa war nṭiƹ ca. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Ȓexxu asenjem nneɣ imɣaren, mammec iy ɣa negg a nenjem zi lƹiqab iƹni meȓa neɣfeȓ x usenjem-a? Awaȓ n usenjem-a ibcar-iṯ-iḏ ḏ amezwaru Siḏiṯneɣ, ṯumma cehḏen xas yinni iy ḏas iṣennṭen ssiwḍen-ṯ-iḏ i neccin. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Icehheḏ xas uȓa ḏ Arebbi s lƹalamaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ ḏ waṭṭas n lʼanwaƹ n lmuƹjizaṯ. S lʼiden nnes ƹaweḏ ifreq lqudraṯ ruḥiyaṯ n Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wenni iy iǧan ḏ zzaƹim n usenjem nneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5-6" />Ȓexxu neccin nessawaȓ x ddunect-a iy tuɣa netraja. Cuf, Arebbi maci i lmalaʼikaṯ umi yuca ȓeḥkam x ddunect-a lla. Aqa ḏinni ijjen n umcan ḏi Lkitab mani icheḏ ijjen x manaya iqqar:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:5-6">
    <char style="bd">&lt;Tfekkareḏ cek ḏeg iryazen, maca min swan? </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:5-6">
    <char style="bd">Mmis n bnaḏem, mayemmi iy ḏayes ɣa ithillan? </char><verse eid="HEB 2:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />
    <char style="bd">Ṯeggiḏ-ṯ ƹȓayen am lmexluqaṯ ujenna yuƹȓan, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 2:7">
    <char style="bd">ṯuciḏ-as ttaj n ȓuweqqar ḏ waṭṭas n ccan, </char><verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />
    <char style="bd">ṯeggiḏ swadday iḍaren nnes marra min iǧan.&gt; </char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:8" />
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:8">Wami igga Arebbi marra swadday iḍaren nnes, war ṯeqqim uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ war xas iḥekkim ca. Innama, ƹaḏ ḏi ȓweqṯ-a war netwiȓi ca marra swadday iḍaren n bnaḏem. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Walakin Ƹisa wah, netwaȓa-ṯ ȓexxu s ttaj nnes n ȓuweqqar ḏ waṭṭas n ccan. Mayemmi? Lʼianna Ƹisa ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ tuɣa isehwa-ṯ-iḏ Arebbi cwayt swadday i lmalaʼikaṯ iƹni wami iṣbar i ȓaƹḏab n ȓmewṯ. Bac netta s arḍa n Arebbi aḏ iqqas ȓmewṯ, ȓmewṯ nni aḏ tiȓi n marra iwḏan.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Zi Arebbi iy tiȓint marra ṯimesȓayin-a u netta umi tiȓint. Ḏ Arebbi netta iy yarrin Ƹisa war ḏayes bu ȓƹib s ȓaƹḏab nni nnes ig xas iƹḏun ḥima Arebbi aḏ d yawi aṭṭas n ṯarwa ɣar lƹaḍama nnes. Ɣares ȓmaƹna manaya ȓaḥeqqac Ƹisa netta ḏ zzaƹim n usenjem n ṯarwa-ya. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Aqa wenni issiṣfan iwḏan zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen u ḏ yiwḏan nni itwassiṣfan, Babaṯsen ḏ ijjen. X manaya war xasen itƹeffar ca aḏasen yini ay ayṯma. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />Lla, iqqar-as <char style="it">i Arebbi</char>: &lt;Aḏ ssiwȓeɣ x yisem nnec ak ayṯma, ḏi ȓwesṭ n jmaƹeṯ ac ḥemḏeɣ s iɣennijen.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />U ƹaweḏ iqqar: &lt;Nec aḏ teyyqeɣ ḏi Arebbi.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 2:13">Iqqar ƹaweḏ: &lt;Aqayi nec ḏ ṯarwa inu iy ḏayi yuca Arebbi.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Iḏen ṯarwa-ya niṯni ḏ iwḏan ḏaysen marra aysum ḏ iḏammen. X manaya Ƹisa uȓa ḏ netta ḏayes ṯimesȓayin-a. Ammu s ȓmewṯ nnes isbeṭṭeȓ zzaƹim n ȓmewṯ iƹni ḏ Ibȓis. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />U ƹaweḏ Ƹisa aḏ d iḍȓeq i yinni iǧan ḏ isemɣan zi ȓexȓuq iƹni yinni xasen ṯḥekkem ṯiggwḏi zi ȓmewṯ uca aḏ iȓin ḥurr.<verse eid="HEB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Cuf, nessen belli Ƹisa war itƹiwin ca lmalaʼikaṯ: Lla, itƹawan ṯarwa n Brahim. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />X manaya tuɣa wa labud Arebbi aḏ yarr Ƹisa am ayṯmas ḏi marra bac aḏ yiȓi ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran ḏayes arraḥmeṯ ḏayes ttiqeṯ ixeddem i Arebbi. U ƹaweḏ <char style="it">ȓefqi-ya</char> aḏ iqeddem lfidya ḥima aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n yiwḏan. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Wami netta s yixef nnes itwaƹeddeb ḏi ȓemḥayen, izemmar aḏ iƹawen yinni iǧan ḏi ȓemḥayen.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa imɣaren x nnabi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Ay ayṯma ṣṣaliḥin, ḏ kenniw iy iǧan ḏ imƹacaren ḏeg uȓaɣi nni iy d yusin zeg ujenna. Fekkareṯ mliḥ ḏi Ƹisa, netta ḏ arrasul netta ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran n lʼiman iy xas ncehheḏ neccin. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Ixḏem Ƹisa s lʼiḏen n wenni iy ṯid iƹeyynen mammec igga nnabi Musa uȓa ḏ netta ixḏem s lʼiḏen n Arebbi ḏi ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ ṯekmaȓ n Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Cuf, Ƹisa yufi-ṯ isḏaheǧ lƹaḍama ktar zi nnabi Musa mammec iǧa bab n ṯeddarṯ isḏaheɣ ccan ktar zi ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ nni iy ḏinni d yurew. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Liʼanna kuȓ ṯaddarṯ ɣares wenni iy ṯen d yurwen u marra ijji-ṯen-d Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Tuɣa nnabi Musa ixeddem nican ḏ amsexxar, itƹawan ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ ṯekmaȓ n Arebbi, icehheḏ x ṯmesȓayin tuɣa ƹaḏ iy ɣa itwabeccaren ḏi lmustaqbel. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Walakin Lmasiḥ netta ḏ Mmis iḥekkem x ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ n Arebbi, itkellaf zzaysen nican. U neccin ḏ ayṯbab-a n ṯeddarṯ nnes iƹni meȓa neṭṭef mliḥ ḏi zƹameṯ nneɣ u ḏi lʼamal nneɣ iy xef nteftaxar.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arraḥeṯ n yinni itamnen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />X manaya ammu iqqar Arruḥ iqeddsen: Nhara meȓa ṯesȓim i ṣṣut n Arebbi, <verse eid="HEB 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />war seqsiḥeṯ ca uȓawen nwem mamc iy ggin Ayṯ-Israʼil wami ḏayi ƹṣan ḏi ȓweqṯ nni n ȓmiḥneṯ ḏi ȓexȓa. <verse eid="HEB 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Ḏeg umcan nni ȓejḏuḏ nwem zeƹƹmen-ayi s ṯɣennant aḏ ẓren nec min ƹenniɣ, waxxa uȓa ḏi arbeƹin iseggwusa ẓrin ȓexḏayem inu. <verse eid="HEB 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />X manayenni sƹeṣṣben-ayi yiwḏan n zman nni. Nniɣ nec aqa ȓebda tbeƹƹaḏen xafi s wuȓawen nsen, ibriḏen inu war ṯen ssinen ca niṯni. <verse eid="HEB 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Ssenni jjuǧeɣ s uɣḍab inu nniɣ ƹemmarṣ aḏ aḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ inu.<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ay ayṯma, ḥḍam ixef nwem bac uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem war ɣares itiȓi wuȓ ḏ abercan niɣ war ḏayes itiȓi bu lʼiman bac war itbeƹƹiḏ ca netta x Arebbi iddaren. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Lla, meȓa nzemmar a nini &lt;nhara&gt;, ataf aḏ tcejjƹem ayawya kuȓ nhar bac war ḏinni itiȓi ḥadd zzaywem aḏ iḏweȓ iqseḥ wuȓ nnes aṯ texḏeƹ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nnes. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Aqa neccin a niȓi ḏ imƹacaren ḏi Lmasiḥ iƹni meȓa neqqim neṭṭef mliḥ aȓ uneggaru ḏi ttiqeṯ nni iy tuɣa ɣarneɣ ḏ amezwaru. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Nhara meȓa ṯesȓim i ṣṣut nnes, war seqsiḥeṯ ca uȓawen nwem mamc iy ggin Ayṯ-Israʼil wami ṯ ƹṣan.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Cuf, min ƹnan yinni isȓin ugin aḏ ggen array i Arebbi? Yac ḏ iwḏan nni marra ig isufeɣ <char style="it">nnabi</char> Musa zi Miṣra niɣ? <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Min ƹnan yinni isƹeṣṣaben Arebbi ḏi arbeƹin iseggwusa nni? Yac ḏ yinni iƹṣan Arebbi menḍaren ḏinni ḏi ȓexȓa nni am immurḍas niɣ? <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />U min ƹnan yinni iy xef ijjuǧ Arebbi inna-asen ƹemmarṣ aḏ aḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ inu? Yac ḏ yinni war itṭiƹin ca niɣ? <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Iwa neccin netwaȓa belli tuɣa war zemmaren ca aḏ aḏfen ḏi <char style="it">arraḥeṯ n Siḏi Arebbi</char> minzi ugin aḏ amnen.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Iḏen fa ƹaḏ nzemmar a naḏef ḏi arraḥeṯ n Siḏi Arebbi minzi ḏaneɣ iwƹeḏ. Wa labud a neggweḏ bac war itɣimi uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaywem war ḏinni d ixeṭṭeȓ. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Liʼanna ȓexbar-a n ȓxir iy ḏaneɣ d itwabeccaren i neccin, uȓa ḏ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ twabeccaren zzayes. Walakin war stenfiƹen ca zzayes wami ugin azzayes amnen. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Cuf, arraḥeṯ nni mixef issawaȓ Arebbi ataf ntaḏef ḏayes neccin iy yumnen. Issiweȓ Arebbi x manaya wami inna: &lt;Qa nec jjuǧeɣ s uɣḍab inu nniɣ ƹemmarṣ aḏ aḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ inu.&gt; Man arraḥeṯ? Iƹni ṯenni n Siḏi Arebbi wami ikemmeȓ ȓexḏayem nnes ixȓeq-d ddunect-a.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lkitab n Imezwura 2:2-3: Wami ikemmeȓ Arebbi marra ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes, ireyyeḥ ḏi nhar wis sebƹa iƹni nhar n ssebṯ. Ssenni ibarek Arebbi nhar nni yarri-ṯ muqeddes ȓaḥeqqac ḏayes ikemmeȓ marra min d ixȓeq.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Iwa ḏeg yijjen n lʼaya amenni ig inna x nhar wis sebƹa: Inna: &lt;Ḏi nhar wis sebƹa ig ireyyeḥ Arebbi zi marra ȓexḏayem nnes.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />U ƹaweḏ ḏi lʼaya nni nneɣni iy xef nessiweȓ qbeȓ inna: &lt;Ƹemmarṣ aḏ aḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ inu.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Iḏen ƹaḏ qqimen ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan aḏ aḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ-a <char style="it">n Siḏi Arebbi</char>, yinni itwabeccaren zi qbeȓ war uḏifen ca ḏinni liʼanna war uminen ca. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />S manaya tuɣa isejjel Arebbi ijjen n ȓweqṯ nneɣni bac a naḏef ḏi arraḥeṯ nnes, ȓweqṯ nni isemma-yas Arebbi &lt;Nhara.&gt; Menbaƹd i waṭṭas n lqurun ig issiweȓ Arebbi s nnabi Dawed wami inna mamc nenna qbeȓ: &lt;Nhara meȓa ṯesȓim i ṣṣut n Arebbi, war seqsiḥeṯ ca uȓawen nwem.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Cuf, maƹlik <char style="it">nnabi</char> Yacuƹa tuɣa issiweḍ ȓejḏuḏ nneɣ ɣar yijjen n arraḥeṯ, ataf Arebbi war issiweȓ ca x yijjen n nhar nneɣni menbaƹd i waṭṭas n lqurun. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Falihaḏa ƹaḏ iqqim ijjen n ssebṯ, iƹni ḏ ijjen n ȓweqṯ n arraḥeṯ i ccaƹb n Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Liʼanna wenni yuḏfen ḏi arraḥeṯ n Arebbi aqa itreyyaḥ zi ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes mammec ireyyeḥ Arebbi zi ȓxeḏmeṯ nni nnes. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Iḏen wa labud a negg lmejhud nneɣ bac a naḏef ḏi arraḥeṯ nni ḥima uȓa ḏ ijjen war iweṭṭi ḏi nnefs n ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Aqa awaȓ n Arebbi iddar netta ifsus, iqḍeƹ aṭṭas ktar zi ssif n ṯnayen n jjihaṯ. Itaḏef aȓ ḏaxeȓ iferreq buḥbeȓ ḏ arruḥ ḏ mani tmunen ȓemfaseȓ, itaḏef ɣar waḏuf. Itmeyyaz jar lʼafkar ḏ lʼaɣraḍ n wuȓ. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />War ḏinni uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯmesȓayṯ zi min d itwaxeȓqen ṯnuffar zi Arebbi. Qaƹ ṯimesȓayin twafeḍḥent-id twaḍharent-id i ṯiṭṭawin n wenni umi ɣa nuc ȓeḥsab nneɣ. <verse eid="HEB 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Iḏen neccin a neṭṭef mliḥ ḏi lʼiman nneɣ iy xef ncehheḏ minzi ɣarneɣ ijjen n ȓefqi ameqqran imɣar yuḏef ḏeg ijennaṯen iƹḏu-ṯen, netta ḏ Ƹisa Mmis n Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa netta ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Cuf, war ɣarneɣ bu ijjen n ȓefqi ameqqran netta war izemmar ca aḏ iḥess zi ḍḍuƹef nneɣ. Wah, ɣarneɣ ijjen ȓefqi kkint xas marra ȓemḥayen; netta am neccin walakin war iggi bu ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Falihaḏa a nqarreb s zƹameṯ ɣar ȓƹarc n Arebbi ḏayes arḍa bac a naf ḏinni arraḥmeṯ ḏ yijjen n arḍa iy ḏaneɣ ɣa iƹawnen ḏi ȓweqṯ n uḥḏaji nneɣ.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Cuf, kuȓ ȓefqi ameqqran tixḍaren-ṯ-iḏ zeg iryazen, ticcen-as ȓweqṯ n ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes bac aḏ ixḏem zzaṯ i Arebbi ƹlaḥsab iwḏan aḏ iqeddem ṣṣeḏqeṯ ḏ dbiḥaṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Izemmar netta aḏ iḥinn x yinni war ifehhmen ca ḏ yinni iffɣen abriḏ minzi netta s yixef nnes ḏayes ḍḍuƹef. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />X manaya wa labud aḏ iqeddem dbiḥaṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nnes nniṯ mammec iy ṯent itqeddam x yiwḏan.<verse eid="HEB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Ƹaweḏ war ḏinni ḥadd iy ɣa isemɣaren ixef nnes aḏ ixḏem s ccan-a iƹni ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran; Lla, ḏ Arebbi iy ḏas iticcen ȓḥaqq nni mammec ḏas ṯ yuca i <char style="it">ȓefqi nni umi qqaren</char> Harun.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Harun netta ḏ umas n Siḏna Musa.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Ammu uȓa ḏ Ƹisa war isemɣar ca ixef nnes aḏ ixḏem s lƹaḍama-ya iƹni ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran; Lla, inna-as Arebbi: &lt;Aqa cek ḏ Mmi, nhara nec ḏewȓeɣ ḏ Babac.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Ƹaweḏ iqqar Arebbi ḏeg yijjen n umcan nneɣni: &lt;Cek ḏ ȓefqi i ȓebda amecnaw lfirqa nni n ȓefqi umi qqaren Malikiṣadiq.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Ḏeg wussan nni iy ḏi tuɣa iddar Ƹisa ḏi ṯmurṯ-a, itẓaǧa itȓaɣa x Arebbi s jjheḏ u s imeṭṭawen itettar-as i wenni izemmaren aṯ isenjem zi ȓmewṯ. Arebbi itṣennaṭ-as wami Ƹisa iteggweḏ zzayes. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Waxxa netta ḏ Mmis <char style="it">n Arebbi</char> iy iǧa, iȓmeḏ ṭṭaƹa s uƹeddeb nni iy xas ikkin. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Wami iƹḏu aƹeddeb nni bȓa ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, iḏweȓ netta ḏ ȓƹunṣar n usenjem iƹni izemmar aḏ isenjem marra yinni iy ṯ itṭaƹan. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Ssenni yarri-ṯ Arebbi ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran amecnaw lfirqa nni n ȓefqi Malikiṣadiq.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yallaheṯ a nuyureṯ ɣar zzaṯ ḥima a nemɣar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Ƹaḏ nzemmar a nini aṭṭas x ṯmesȓayin-a walakin iqseḥ akenniw nsefhem. Mayemmi? Liʼanna kenniw ṯḏeqȓem aḏ tfehmem. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Cuf, wa labud kenniw ȓexxu aḏ tiȓim ḏ imseȓmaḏen walakin ƹaḏ itxeṣṣa-yawem ijjen akenniw isɣar s ṯɣuri nni ṯamezwarut zeg wawaȓ n Arebbi. Kenniw teḥḏajam aɣi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aɣi netta ḏ aceffay ḏi ȓebƹaḍ n imucan ḏi Arrif.</char></note> waha, maci lmakla ḏ ṣṣaḥ. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Kuȓ ijjen ƹaḏ ḏ aseymi itƹic s uɣi waha, iƹni war ifehhem ca i useȓmeḏ x min iṣeȓḥen. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Walakin lmakla n ṣṣaḥ tetten-teṯ ɣir yinni war iǧin ca ḏ iseyman. Niṯni zemmaren i lmakla nni n ṣṣaḥ minzi ȓebda xeddmen i ṯɣuri nni iy qqaren tmeyyazen jar min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ḏ jar min iǧan ḏ aƹeffan.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />X manaya war netɣimiṯ ca ḏi ttaƹlim-a amezwaru x Lmasiḥ, a nuyureṯ ɣar zzaṯ bac a nemɣar. War ntaƹqib ca ɣar dsas. Iƹni war nessawaȓ ca ƹaḏ x ttuba nni n ssayiʼaṯ, niɣ x mammec ɣa negg a namen zi Arebbi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />niɣ x ibriḏen bac aḏ twaṭehharen yiwḏan s waman, niɣ x mammec ɣa negg a nsers ifassen nneɣ x yiwḏan, niɣ x lqiyama n imettinen, niɣ x Lḥisab nni war ifennin ca. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Iwa, a nuyureṯ ɣar zzaṯ iƹni meȓa ixes Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Amma yinni mixef iceƹceƹ nnur, qqasen lhadiya n ujenna, carrcen ḏi Arruḥ iqeddsen, <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />ḏuwqen ƹaweḏ zi lbaraka n wawaȓ n Arebbi ḏ lquduraṯ n zman iy d ɣa yasen. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />Yina meȓa ffɣen abriḏ, war iǧi wi ṯen d ɣa yarren ɣar ttuba. Mayemmi? Liʼanna yina aḏ iȓin am tṣellaben Mmis n Arebbi ƹaweḏ x ṣṣalib tƹeyyaben-ṯ zzaṯ i yiwḏan.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Cuf, meȓa ṯamurṯ iccaṯ xas unẓar aṭṭas nettaṯ ṯsess ticc ṯafeǧaḥṯ, ataf aḏ tawi ijjen n lbaraka zi Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Walakin meȓa ṯamurṯ nni ṯseɣmay-d ɣir isennanen ḏ ṯzeggwarṯ, ataf nettaṯ ḏ walu aqat ḏi lxaṭar aḏ twanƹeȓ, aȓ uneggaru at sḥarqen s ṯmessi.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Ay imƹizzen inu, waxxa nessawaȓ ammu neccin metʼakeddin zzaywem iƹni x ṯmesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin iy zi ɣa ṯnejmem. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Iwa Arebbi, ma iticc ȓḥaqq ma lla? Wah, Arebbi war itettu ca ȓxeḏmeṯ nwem ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nni ḏas d ṯseḍharem wami ṯƹawnem ṣṣaliḥin. U ƹaḏ teggem manaya. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Nexs aḏ tḥawȓem kenniw s wuȓ kuȓ ijjen am qbeȓ bac aḏ tiȓim kenniw metʼakeddin ḏi lʼamal nwem aȓ uneggaru. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />War nexs ca aḏ tƹegzem. Itxeṣṣa aḏ tiȓim am yinni itwaraṯen s ṣṣbar ḏ lʼiman nsen x ṯmesȓayin nni iy zi ṯen iwƹeḏ <char style="it">Arebbi</char>.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Cuf, wami Arebbi iwƹeḏ Brahim <char style="it">x ȓƹaheḏ nni</char>, ijjuǧ Arebbi aḏ icc ixef nnes. Mayemmi? Liʼanna war ḏinni ḥadd imɣar ktar zi Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Inna-as: &lt;Nec jjuǧeɣ qa ac barkeɣ s yijjen n lbaraka ṯemɣar, aḏ semɣareɣ ddurriṯ nnec.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Iwa ammu wami iraja Brahim s yijjen n ṣṣbar yuweḍ-as-d min zi ṯ iwƹeḏ Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Liʼanna iwḏan tjuǧen s yijjen ḏ ameqqran zzaysen. U s yijjen n ṯjaǧiṯ aḏ ḥaqqen marra lqadiyaṯ nsen aḏ kemmȓent. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />X manaya iḍmen Arebbi manayenni s yijjen n ṯjaǧiṯ i yinni iy ɣa iwarṯen min zi ṯen iwƹeḏ. Iƹni ixes aḏasen d iseḍhar mliḥ ṭṭabiƹa n lɣaraḍ nnes ƹemmarṣ aḏ twabeddeȓ. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Ṯnayen n ṯmesȓayin-a war twabeddiȓent ca,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Min ƹnant ṯnayen n ṯmesȓayin-a? Iƹni min iwƹeḏ ḏ min xas ijjuǧ.</char></note> Arebbi war izemmar axasent isxarreq. Zi ṯnayen n ṯmesȓayin-a azzaysent iy ɣa netwacejjeƹ neccin iy narweȓ bac aɣares nnuffar. Zzaysent iy ɣa neṭṭef s jjheḏ ḏi lʼamal iy ḏaneɣ itwabeccaren. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Lʼamal-a itiȓi ɣarneɣ am yijjen n uȓiyzim n uɣarrabu n ȓaƹmar nneɣ, irseq s jjheḏ war iḍeǧeq. Yuḏef lʼamal-a iƹḏu ɣar ḏeffar n arrwaq n Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Ḏeg umcan nni yuḏef Ƹisa ḏinni ḏ amezwaru ƹlaḥsab neccin, iḏweȓ ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran i ȓebda amecnaw lfirqa nni n ȓefqi umi qqaren Malikiṣadiq.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Lfirqa n ȓefqi ameqqran Malikiṣadiq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Cuf, Malikiṣadiq nni tuɣaṯ netta ḏ azeǧiḏ n ṯendint n Salim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯandint n Salim nettaṯ ḏ ṯandint n Lquds.</char></note> ḏ ȓefqi n Siḏi Arebbi Yuƹȓan. Iruḥ imeȓqa ak Brahim ibarek-iṯ. Manaya iwqeƹ wami d itrewwaḥ Brahim zi ȓḥarb nni iy ḏi iɣȓeb izeǧiḏen. <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Yuca-as Brahim i Malikiṣadiq ȓaƹcur, ƹecra ḏi miyya zi marra. Ḏ amezwaru ȓmaƹna n yisem-a n Malikiṣadiq ixes aḏ yini &lt;Azeǧiḏ n ṣṣulḥ.&gt; U ƹaweḏ netta ḏ Lmalik n ṯendint n Salim iƹni ḏ azeǧiḏ n ȓehna. <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />War ɣares ntif lla babas lla yemmas lla ȓejḏuḏ nnes. War ɣares ntif amezwaru n ȓiyyam nnes uȓa ḏ aneggaru n ṯuḏarṯ nnes. Netta itcabbah ḏi Mmis n Arebbi, iddar am ȓefqi ameqqran i ȓebda. <verse eid="HEB 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Iwa fekkareṯ netta mecḥaȓ ḏ ameqqran, waxxa ḏ jeddiṯneɣ ameqqran Brahim yuca-as ȓaƹcur, ƹecra ḏi miyya zi marra agȓa nni ig irbeḥ zeg izeǧiḏen nni!<verse eid="HEB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Ḏinni ƹaweḏ ijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ ḏi Ccariƹa n Musa tweṣṣa yinni iǧan ḏ ȓfuqaha zi Ayṯ-Lawi aḏ ysin ȓaƹcur zeg yiwḏan iƹni zi ayṯmaṯsen, waxxa uȓa ḏ ayṯmaṯsen ijji-ṯen-d jeddiṯsen ameqqran Brahim. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Walakin aryaz-a Malikiṣadiq war iǧi ca zi Ayṯ-Lawi, iysi ȓaƹcur zi Brahim uca Malikiṣadiq ibarek Brahim wenni umi ɣar ǧan lwuƹud. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />U bȓa ccekk wenni ameqqran aḏ yuc lbaraka i wenni amezyan. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Ayṯ-Lawi ig ikessin ȓaƹcur iƹni niṯni ḏ iwḏan ƹadi tmettan. Walakin Malikiṣadiq ig iysin ȓaƹcur nni icehheḏ xas Lkitab belli netta iddar. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Iwa nzemmar a nini Lawi netta s yixef nnes iy ikessi ȓaƹcur zeg yiwḏan, issekk-iṯ x ufus n Brahim ɣar Malikiṣadiq liʼanna Brahim netta ḏ jeddis ameqqran. <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />Mammec manaya? Wami Brahim imeȓqa ak Malikiṣadiq, tuɣa Lawi ƹaḏ ɣar ḏaxeȓ n ddat n Brahim iƹni jeddis ameqqran.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Iḏen, maƹlik ccɣeȓ nni iy xeddmen ȓfuqaha n Ayṯ-Lawi war ḏas inqis walu, mayemmi ƹaḏ tuɣa ɣa neḥḏaj aḏ d yas ijjen n ȓefqi nneɣni amecnaw lfirqa n Malikiṣadiq, maci zi lfirqa nni <char style="it">ƹadi</char> n Harun <char style="it">n Ayṯ-Lawi</char>? <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />U cuf, meȓa ibeddeȓ ccɣeȓ nni iy xeddmen ȓfuqaha n Ayṯ-Lawi ataf wa labud aḏ tbeddeȓ ƹaweḏ can ȓḥajeṯ ḏi ccariƹa. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Liʼanna wenni iy xef nessawaȓ iƹni Ƹisa netta yusa-d zi ṯeqbiȓṯ nneɣni <char style="it">maci zi ṯeqbiȓṯ n Ayṯ-Lawi</char>. Zi ṯeqbiȓṯ nnes ƹemmarṣ war ixḏim can yijjen ḏ ȓefqi ɣar ȓmeḏbaḥ. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Liʼanna nessen Siḏiṯneɣ yusa-d zi ṯeqbiȓṯ n Ayṯ-Yahuḏa. Ƹemmarṣ ma inna Musa aḏ d ffɣen ȓfuqaha zi ṯeqbiȓṯ nni.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Ȓexxu marra manaya itwaḍhar-d mliḥ wami d imeḍhar ijjen n ȓefqi nneɣni, <char style="it">iƹni ḏ Ƹisa,</char> amecnaw lfirqa n Malikiṣadiq. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Iƹni maci ƹlaḥsab ijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ x ȓejḏuḏ nnes zi ccariƹa iy ṯ yarrin ḏ ȓefqi; Lla, netta ḏ ȓefqi ƹlaḥsab jjheḏ n ṯuḏarṯ nnes ƹemmarṣ aḏ tefna. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Aqa icehheḏ xas Lkitab: &lt;Cek ḏ ȓefqi i ȓebda amecnaw lfirqa n Malikiṣadiq.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Ȓuṣiyeṯ nni ḏ ṯaqḏint ṯetwabeddeȓ wami ṯetwaḥsab ṯeḍƹef bȓa nnfaƹ. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Iffeɣ-d ijjen lʼamal ḥsen <char style="it">zi ȓuṣiyeṯ nni</char>, zzayes iy ɣa nqarreb ɣar Arebbi ȓaḥeqqac Ccariƹa n Musa war d tarri uȓa ḏ ijjen ȓḥajeṯ war ḏayes bu ȓƹib.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />
    <char style="it">Lʼamal-a</char> wanita maci waḥḏes, akiḏes ijjen n ṯjaǧiṯ. Yinni iḏewȓen qbeȓ ḏ ȓfuqaha arrin-ṯen ḏ ȓfuqaha bȓa ṯjaǧiṯ. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Walakin Ƹisa yarri-ṯ Arebbi ḏ ȓefqi s yijjen n ṯjaǧiṯ wami ḏas inna: &lt;Aqa Siḏi Arebbi ijjuǧ u ƹemmarṣ aḏ ibeddeȓ array nnes, inna-as qa cek ḏ ȓefqi i ȓebda.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" /><char style="it">Ṯjaǧiṯ nni n Arebbi</char> ḏ nettaṯ ig yarrin Ƹisa aḏ iḍemmen ijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḥsen <char style="it">zi ȓƹaheḏ nni aqḏim</char>.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Ȓfuqaha nni n Ayṯ-Lawi niṯni aṭṭas iḏsen, mayemmi? Liʼanna ȓmewṯ war ṯen tejji ca aḏ dumen ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Walakin Ƹisa ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes n ȓefqi aḏ teqqim war twakkis ca liʼanna netta itduma i ȓebda. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />X manaya yinni zzayes itqarraben ɣar Arebbi izemmar Ƹisa aṯen isenjem i ȓebda. Mayemmi? Liʼanna netta iddar i ȓebda aḏaysen itcafaƹ.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Cuf, ijjen n ȓefqi ameqqran am wanita ḏ netta iy neḥḏaj. Netta ƹaḍim, bȓa ȓƹib, iṣfa, ineƹzeȓ zeg yiwḏan iy ggin ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, itwasemɣar yuƹȓa x ijennaṯen. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Netta maci am ȓfuqaha nni nneɣni imeqqranen teḥḏajan niṯni aḏ qeddmen dbiḥaṯ kuȓ nhar iƹni x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen u menbaƹd x ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n yiwḏan. Mayemmi? Liʼanna igga manaya <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> icten n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda qaƹ wami iqeddem ixef nnes ḏ lfidya x yiwḏan. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Liʼanna Ccariƹa n Musa tarra iryazen s ḍḍuƹef nsen aḏ iȓin ḏ ȓfuqaha imeqqranen. Walakin Arebbi s ṯjaǧiṯ nnes iy d yusin menbaƹd i Ccariƹa n Musa yarra Mmis ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran iḏweȓ netta bȓa ȓƹib qaƹ i ȓebda.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran n yijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Iwa, min iǧan muhim ḏi min neqqar? Iƹni ijjen n ȓefqi ameqqran am wenni iy xef nessiweȓ aqaṯ ɣarneɣ neccin. Iqqim netta x ufusi n lƹarc n Arebbi Subḥana wa Tƹala ḏeg ujenna. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Netta ixeddem ḏi ṯemziḏa nni iƹni ḏ aqiḍun nni n ṣṣaḥ lƹaḍim iy igga Siḏi Arebbi maci bnaḏem.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Cuf, kuȓ ȓefqi ameqqran tixḍaren-ṯ bac aḏ iqeddem ṣṣeḏqeṯ ḏ dbiḥaṯ. X manaya wa labud ȓefqi wanita <char style="it">iƹni ḏ Ƹisa</char> aḏ iqeddem can n ȓḥajeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Maƹlik iǧa netta ḏi ṯmurṯ-a, ataf war izemmar aḏ ixḏem ḏ ȓefqi liʼanna ḏanita ȓfuqaha n Ayṯ-Lawi itqeddamen ṣṣeḏqaṯ ƹlaḥsab Ccariƹa n Musa. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Yina xeddmen ccɣeȓ nsen ḏeg yijjen n ṯemziḏa nettaṯ am yijjen n ṯiȓi itemcabbahen ḏi min iǧan ḏeg ujenna. X manayenni Arebbi iƹȓem i Musa wami ibḏa isbedda Aqiḍun nni Ameqqran inna-as: &lt;Fekkar bac aḏ teggeḏ marra min ḏac xaṭṭeɣ ḏi lxariṭa nni ḏeg uḏrar.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Walakin ccɣeȓ nni n ȓefqi iy ḏas yuca i Ƹisa imɣar aṭṭas x ccɣeȓ nni aqḏim n ȓfuqaha nneɣni. U ȓƹaheḏ-a iy xef itcafaƹ netta imɣar aṭṭas x wenni aqḏim, liʼanna ibedd x yijjen n dsas n lwuƹud iy iǧan ḥsen.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Maƹlik ȓƹaheḏ nni amezwaru war ḏas inqis walu, ataf war rezzun ca x wis ṯnayen. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Liʼanna Arebbi yufa iwḏan nni ḏ ineqsiyen wami inna:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 8:8" />
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">&lt;<char style="bd">Aqa tasen-d wussan, iqqar-iṯ Siḏi Arebbi, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="bd">aḏaysen ggeɣ ijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="bd">i Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ Ayṯ-Yahuḏa. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />
    <char style="bd">Maci am ȓƹaheḏ nni iy ggiɣ ak ȓejḏuḏ nsen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="bd">wami ṯen ṭṭfeɣ zeg ifassen nsen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="bd">aṯen sufɣeɣ zi ṯmurṯ n Miṣra. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="bd">Liʼanna niṯni war ṭṭifen ca ḏi ȓƹaheḏ inu, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="bd">uca nec semḥeɣ ḏaysen, iqqar-iṯ Siḏi Arebbi. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />
    <char style="bd">Ḏ wanita ḏ ȓƹaheḏ iy ɣa ggeɣ ak Ayṯ-Israʼil </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="bd">menbaƹd i ȓweqṯ nni, iqqar-iṯ Siḏi Arebbi. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="bd">Aḏasen siḏfeɣ ȓuṣiyaṯ inu ḏi ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="bd">aɣarsen iȓint ḏ ṯira x wuȓawen nsen. </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="bd">Aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ Arebbi nsen aḏ iȓin ḏ ccaƹb inu. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />
    <char style="bd">Maci kur ijjen aḏas iseȓmeḏ i wajjar nnes, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="bd">niɣ i wumas aḏas yini: Ssen Siḏi Arebbi. </char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="bd">Lla, marra iḏsen aḏayi ssnen nec, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="bd">s umezyan nsen aȓ umeqqran nsen. </char><verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />
    <char style="bd">Aqa nec aḏasen ɣfareɣ i ccarr nsen, </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 8:12">
    <char style="bd">ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen war ḏaysent tfekkareɣ ca ƹaḏ.&gt; </char><verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Wami issiweȓ Arebbi x yijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ, ṣafi wenni amezwaru isbeṭṭaȓ-iṯ. U wenni ig itwasbeṭṭaȓen ȓexxu iḏewweȓ ḏ aqḏim, ataf ḏeɣya aḏ itwakkes war itɣimi ca.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Lƹibada ṯamezwarut ḏeg Uqiḍun Ameqqran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Ȓƹaheḏ nni amezwaru tuɣa ɣares can n lqawanin n lƹibada u ḏ ijjen n umcan amqeddes ḏi ddunect-a. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Iƹni sewjaḏen ijjen n Uqiḍun Ameqqran <char style="it">ḏayes ṯnayen n ixammen</char>. Ḏeg uxxam amezwaru ggin ḏayes ȓqendiȓ ḏ ṭṭabȓa mani srusan aɣrum nni itqeddamen ḏ ṣṣeḏqeṯ i Arebbi. Axxam nni qqaren-as &lt;Axxam Amqeddes.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Ṯumma ḏinni ijjen n arrwaq,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Arrwaq-a netta ḏ arrwaq wis ṯnayen.</char></note> ɣar ḏeffar nnes ḏinni ijjen n uxxam wis ṯnayen qqaren-as &lt;Axxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas.&gt; <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Ḏayes ȓmejmar n tbaxur icellel s ddheb, u ḏ tabut n ȓƹaheḏ marra iɣezḏisen nnes u ḏ ṯisi nnes celllen s ddheb. Ḏi tabut-a ḏayes aqnuc itwaṣenneƹ s ddheb, aqnuc nni ḏayes aɣrum umi qqaren lmanna. <char style="it">Tabut-a</char> ƹaweḏ ḏayes ṯaɣȓiṯ n Harun ṯnewwar, ḏ ṯeȓwiḥin n ƹecra n ȓuṣiyaṯ. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Ṯaqebbarṯ n tabut-a xas ṯnayen n lmexluqaṯ n lƹaḍama ggin am munikuṯ ɣarsen afriwen. Ṯiȓi n wafriwen nsen ṯɣeṭṭa ṯaqebbarṯ-a ṯanita n arraḥmeṯ. Walakin neccin ḏi ȓweqṯ-a war nzemmar a nweṣṣef ṯimesȓayin-a ṯa s ṯa.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Wami swejḏen marra ṯimesȓayin-a ammu, tuɣa taḏfen ȓfuqaha ɣar uxxam amezwaru kuȓ nhar ḏi lʼawqat nnes, teggen ccɣeȓ nsen. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Walakin axxam nni wis ṯnayen itraḥ ḏinni ɣir ȓefqi ameqqran, ijjen n ṯwaȓa ḏi lƹam u ṣafi. Wa labud akiḏes yawi ca n iḏammen bac aṯen iqeddem x yixef nnes u x ddnub iy ggin ccaƹb bȓa ma ṯent ssnen. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Min ḏaneɣ d isbiyyen Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏi manaya? Isbiyyen-aneɣ-d meȓa ƹaḏ iqqim Uqiḍun nni Ameqqran, ataf war innurzem ca ubriḏ ɣar min iǧan ḏ amqeddes aṭṭas. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Marra manaya iticc ijjen lmiṯal i ȓweqṯ-a iy ḏi neǧa ȓexxu. Ccɣeȓ nni iy tuɣa teggen ḏinni xmi tqeddamen ṣṣeḏqeṯ ḏ dbiḥaṯ war izemmar ca aḏ issiṣfa ḍḍamir n wenni iƹebbḏen. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Manaya ɣir ḏayes can n lqawanin n ccariƹa x lmakla ḏ ṯsessi ḏ ȓuḍu. Lqawanin-a war ǧin ca x wuȓawen n bnaḏem, xeddmen ḥetta ȓweqṯ n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ u ṣafi.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Fa Lmasiḥ wami d iḥḍar ḏ ȓefqi ameqqran n ṯmesȓayin-a iy d yusin, iƹni yuḏef aqiḍun nni iǧan ƹaḍim war ḏas inqis walu war ṯ bnin ca ifassen n bnaḏem, war iǧi ca zi min d itwaxeȓqen ḏi ddunect-a. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Yuḏef ijjen n ṯwaȓa u ṣafi ɣar Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas. Netta war yuḏif ca s iḏammen n iɣayḏen niɣ ḏ iyenduzen; Lla, yuḏef s iḏammen nnes nniṯ ixeǧes xaneɣ lfidya bac a nenjem i ȓebda. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Cuf, iḏammen n iɣayḏen ḏ iyenduzen ḏ yiɣɣeḏ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iɣeḏ netta ḏ ṯnifesṯ.</char></note> n ṯfunast truccan zzaysen yinni ixenzen issiṣfa-ṯen bac aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ imenqawiyen. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Meȓa amenni, mecḥaȓ iy ḏaneɣ ɣa ssiṣfan iḏammen n Lmasiḥ ktar! Netta iruḥ s Arruḥ nni itduman i ȓebda iqeddem ixef nnes bȓa ȓƹib i Arebbi, iḏammen nnes aḏaneɣ ssiṣfan ḍḍamir nneɣ zi ssayiʼaṯ bac a neƹbeḏ Arebbi iddaren.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Falihaḏa netta Lmasiḥ itcafaƹ jaraneɣ ḏ Arebbi s yijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ bac yinni umi d iȓaɣa Arebbi ataf aḏ awin lwareṯ iy zi ṯen iwƹeḏ itduman i ȓebda. Liʼanna Lmasiḥ immuṯ ḏ lfidya ḥima aḏasen iḍȓeq aḏ iȓin ḥurr zi ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ iy ggin swadday i ȓƹaheḏ nni amezwaru.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Cuf, ƹlaḥsab lwaṣiya labud aḏ d awin chada n lwafat n wenni iggin lwaṣiya. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Liʼanna lwaṣiya war ṯṣeǧeḥ ca illa meȓa immuṯ bab nnes. Meȓa ƹaḏ iddar bab nnes iƹni wenni iy t yurin ataf war ṯṣeǧeḥ ca. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />X manaya tuɣa waxxa ḏ ȓƹaheḏ amezwaru war iṣeǧeḥ ca ḥetta wami uzzȓen iḏammen. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Aqa nnabi Musa wami iɣra kuȓ ȓuṣiyeṯ i marra ccaƹb, ṯumma iysi iḏammen n iyenduzen ḏ iɣayḏen ixelleṭ-iṯen ak waman, ṯumma irucc zzaysen Lkitab s yixef nnes ḏ marra ccaƹb s ṯaḍufṯ ṯazeggwaɣṯ ḏ uzuy.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zuy netta ḏ ijjen n arbiƹ. Ɣeṭṭsen-ṯ ḏeg iḏammen truccan zzayes. </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Inna-asen qa yina ḏ iḏammen n ȓƹaheḏ iy ḏawem yumar Arebbi aḏ teggem. <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Amenni ƹaweḏ irucc Aqiḍun Ameqqran s iḏammen-a ḏ marra ȓeqcuƹ iy ḏayes staƹmaȓen ḏi lƹibada. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />U ḏ ṣṣaḥ ƹlaḥsab Ccariƹa n Musa ƹȓayen marra ṯimesȓayin aḏ twassiṣfant s iḏammen. U bȓa ma aḏ azzȓen iḏammen ataf ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ war twaɣfirent ca.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Iḏen, ṯimesȓayin-a itcabbahen ḏi ṯmesȓayin nni n ujenna tuɣa twassiṣfant s dbiḥaṯ. Walakin ṯimesȓayin nni s yixef nsent n ujenna lla; Twassiṣfant niṯenti s yijjen n nnuƹ n dbiḥaṯ ḥsen zi ṯinni nneɣni. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Cuf, Lmasiḥ war yuḏif ca Axxam nni Amqeddes Aṭṭas iy ibnan s ifassen n bnaḏem itcabbahen waha ḏeg wenni n ṣṣaḥ; Lla, netta yuḏef ḏeg ujenna nniṯ aḏ iḥḍar zzaṯ i Arebbi ƹlaḥsab neccin. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />War yuḏif ca ḏeg ujenna bac aḏ itqeddam ixef nnes aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin amecnaw mamc itegg ȓefqi nni ameqqran xmi itaḏef kuȓ lƹam ɣar Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas s iḏammen maci nnes. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Maƹlik amenni tuɣa ataf labud Lmasiḥ itwaƹeddab aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin zeg wami twaxȓeq ddunect-a. Walakin lla, ihwa-d netta ijjen n ṯwaȓa aȓ uneggaru n zmanaṯ bac aḏ isbeṭṭeȓ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ wami iqeddem ixef nnes ḏ dbiḥeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Ȓmewṯ itmetta-t bnaḏem ijjen n ṯwaȓa, ṯumma iḏeffar-it Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Ammu Lmasiḥ, itwaqeddem ḏ dbiḥeṯ ijjen n ṯwaȓa bac aḏ yarbu ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ n waṭṭas n yiwḏan. Ṯumma aḏ d ihwa wis marrṯayen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa aḏ d ihwa wis marrṯayen ɣar ddunect-a ḏi Nhar Aneggaru.</char></note> Mayemmi? Maci ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ n yiwḏan ƹaweḏ; Lla, aḏ d ihwa bac aḏ isenjem yinni iy ṯ itrajan.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ig isenjamen maci ḏ ccariƹa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Cuf, Ccariƹa n Musa nettaṯ ɣir ḏ ijjen n ṯiȓi n ṯmesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin iy d ɣa yasen, war ṯeǧi ca nettaṯ ḏ ṯimesȓayin nni ḏ ṣṣaḥ. X manaya, dbiḥaṯ nni n ccariƹa iy teggen zi lƹam ɣar lƹam war zemmarent ƹemmarṣ aḏ ssiṣfant yinni itqarraben ɣar Arebbi aḏ iȓin bȓa ȓƹib. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Dbiḥaṯ nni maƹlik zemmarent aḏ ssiṣfant, ataf ṣafi sbedden-ṯent niɣ lla? Liʼanna yinni iƹebbḏen ataf aḏ qqimen ḏ imenqawiyen ijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda, ataf ḍḍamir nsen war itƹeddib ca s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Walakin dbiḥaṯ nni min ƹnant? Niṯenti tfekkarent-aneɣ kuȓ lƹam s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Liʼanna iḏammen n iyenduzen ḏ iɣayḏen war zemmaren ca aḏ kksen ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, war itemkin ca.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />X manaya, wami d yusa Lmasiḥ ɣar ddunect-a inna-as <char style="it">i Arebbi</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">&lt;Ṯeswejḏeḏ-ayi ijjen n ddat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:5">war ṯerzuḏ ca dbiḥaṯ ḏ ṣṣeḏqeṯ lla.<verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Tuɣa war ḏac iteƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ aḏac scemḍen lḥayawanaṯ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:6">aḏac qeddmen ṣṣeḏqeṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Uca nniɣ, Ay Arebbi aqayi usiɣ-d</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">aḏ ggeɣ ȓxaḍar nnec,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:7">mamc xafi yura ḏi Lkitab.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Ḏ amezwaru inna-as qa dbiḥaṯ ḏ ṣṣeḏqeṯ war ṯent ṯerzuḏ ca cek, war ḏac iteƹjib bu ȓḥaȓ aḏac cemḍen lḥayawanaṯ aḏac qeddmen ṣṣeḏqeṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. (Ṯina tqeddamen-ṯent ƹlaḥsab ccariƹa.) <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Ṯumma inna-as aqayi usiɣ-d aḏ ggeɣ ȓxaḍar nnec. Iƹni aḏ ikkes dbiḥaṯ nni ṯimezwura aḏ igg ḏeg umcan nsent dbiḥeṯ wis ṯnayen <char style="it">n Lmasiḥ</char>. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />U s ȓxaḍar nni neccin netwassiṣfa s dbiḥeṯ n ddat n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, ijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Ȓefqi kuȓ nhar itɣima netta itegg ccɣeȓ-a nnes, iƹni itqeddam aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin nnefs n dbiḥaṯ, walakin dbiḥaṯ nni war zemmarent ca aḏ kksent ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Lmasiḥ lla, netta iqeddem ijjen n dbiḥeṯ waḥḏes x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ ijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda, uca iqqim netta x ufusi n Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />Ssenni iqqim itraja ȓƹaḏyan nnes aḏ iȓin swadday iḍaren nnes. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Liʼanna yinni itḏewwaȓen ḏ ṣṣaliḥin issiṣfa-ṯen ḏeg yijjen n ṯwaȓa i ȓebda s yijjen n dbiḥeṯ u ṣafi bac aḏ iȓin bȓa ȓƹib.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Fa icehheḏ-aneɣ Arruḥ iqeddsen x manaya. Ḏ amezwaru iqqar:<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />&lt;Ḏ wanita ḏ ȓƹaheḏ iy ɣa ggeɣ ak Ayṯ-Israʼil</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">menbaƹd i ȓweqṯ nni, iqqar-iṯ Siḏi Arebbi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">Aḏasen siḏfeɣ ȓuṣiyaṯ inu ḏeg wuȓawen nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:16">aɣarsen iȓint ḏ ṯira x ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Ssenni yarni inna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">&lt;Ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen ḏ ssayiʼaṯ nsen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 10:17">war ḏaysent tfekkareɣ ca ƹaḏ.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Ṯina, meȓa twaɣfarent maci ƹaḏ aḏ iqeddem can yijjen dbiḥeṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yallaheṯ a naḏfeṯ ɣar Arebbi s lʼiman</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19-20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19-20" />Iḏen fa ay ayṯma, ɣarneɣ ijjen n zƹameṯ bac a naḏef ɣar Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas s iḏammen n Ƹisa iƹni s yijjen n ubriḏ ḏ jḏiḏ iddaren, innurzem-aneɣ wami iqqarṣ arrwaq nni iƹni ddat nnes.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.19-20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wami immuṯ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa x ṣṣalib, ḏi ȓweqṯ nni ig iqqarṣ arrwaq ḏi ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant. Arrwaq nni aqaṯ jar Uxxam Amqeddes ḏ Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas, ḏ wenni ig iǧan ḏ ȓḥiḍ jarasen. Immuṯ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa u ṣafi innurzem ubriḏ jar ixammen nni.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:19-20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21-22" />Ɣarneɣ ijjen n ȓefqi ameqqran imɣar netta iḥekkem x ṯeddarṯ n Arebbi. Ƹlaḥsab ȓefqi-ya iy ɣarneɣ, a nqarrbeṯ ɣar Arebbi s yijjen n wuȓ ḏ acemȓaȓ ḏ yijjen n ttiqeṯ ṯejheḏ. Ƹaweḏ uȓawen nneɣ aḏ iȓin twaruccen bac ḍḍamir nneɣ aḏ itwassiṣfa war itƹeddib ca s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. U ƹaweḏ ddat nneɣ aḏ tiȓi twasireḏ s waman iṣfan. <verse eid="HEB 10:21-22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />A neṭṭef bȓa ma a neḍȓeq ḏi lʼamal nni iy xef ncehheḏ liʼanna Arebbi iy ḏaneɣ iweƹḏen ḏayes ttiqeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Neccin a nxemmem mliḥ mammec iy ɣa negg a nweṣṣa ayawya x ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ lḥasanaṯ. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />A nmun ak wayawya maci a nesmeḥ ḏi lwajib-a am mammec nnumen [nnimen] ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan. Lla, a ncejjeƹ ayawya, u ktar ƹaḏ xmi netwaȓa Nhar n Siḏiṯneɣ iqarreb-d.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Cuf, neccin meȓa netƹic s ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ s ȓxaḍar nneɣ u nessen lḥaqiqa, ataf war ɣarneɣ bu can dbiḥeṯ aḏ tekkes ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ nneɣ. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Lla, neccin ɣir netraja ijjen n Lḥisab ḏ Lƹiqab s ṯiggwḏi ḏ yijjen n ṯmessi ṯḥeddeq aḏ tecc ȓƹaḏyan n Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Wenni tuɣa ixeȓfen ḏi Ccariƹa n Musa, meȓa cehḏen xas ṯnayen niɣ ṯȓaṯa n ȓechuḏ ataf aḏ immeṯ bȓa ma ṯ reḥmen. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Y kenniw, min tfekkarem? Mecḥaȓ iy ɣa yiȓi lƹiqab ig isḏaheǧ wenni iseḥqaren Mmis n Arebbi, isexnez iḏammen n ȓƹaheḏ nni iy zi itwassiṣfa, izebbeȓ Arruḥ n arḍa! <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Aqa neccin nessen belli ḏ Arebbi ig innan qa ḏ nec ig itentaqamen aṯen xeǧseɣ. <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Meȓa ijjen ḥekkmen xas ifassen n Arebbi iddaren, ataf manaya isaggwaḏ.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Fa ƹeqȓeṯ x wussan nni iƹḏun wami xawem d iceƹceƹ nnur. Ṯeṣbarem x yijjen n umenɣi iqseḥ, ṯwajham aƹeddeb. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Ȓebƹaḍ n ṯwaȓaṯin tzebbaȓen-kenniw tƹeddaben-kenniw, iwḏan tfurrujen xawem. Ȓebƹaḍ n ṯwaȓaṯin tƹawanem yinni itwaƹeddaben tbeddam akiḏsen. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Liʼanna imeḥbas qqimen ḏaywem ḏeg wuȓ. Ƹaweḏ ṯeṣbarem s ȓefraḥeṯ wami ḏawem kksin agȓa nwem, tuɣa tessnem ƹaḏ aɣarwem yiȓi ijjen n wagȓa ḥsen zeg unneɣni, itduman.<verse eid="HEB 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Iḏen ejjeṯ ttiqeṯ nwem, nettaṯ aḏawem d ṯawi ijjen n lʼajar imɣar. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Aqa itxeṣṣa aḏ teṣbarem, mayemmi? Bac xmi ɣa ṯeggem ȓxaḍar n Arebbi, ataf aɣarwem yiȓi minzi iy kenniw iwƹeḏ. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Liʼanna ṯeqqim ḏrust n ȓweqṯ aḏ d yaweḍ wenni iy d itasen war itƹeṭṭaȓ ca. <verse eid="HEB 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Walakin wenni iǧan nican aḏ iƹic s lʼiman. Meȓa iƹqeb ɣar ḏeffar ataf war xas reṭṭiɣ ca.<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Walakin neccin maci zeg yinni itƹeqaben ɣar ḏeffar bac a nefna; Lla, neccin zeg yinni itamnen a nsenjem ȓaƹmar nneɣ.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Lʼiman ḏ yinni iy zzayes itƹicen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Fa lʼiman netta ḏ ijjen n ttiqeṯ ijehḏen ḏi min netraja, neccin metʼakkadin ḏi ṯmesȓayin waxxa war ṯent netwiȓi ca. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />S lʼiman-a iy twacekkaren iwḏan n zman.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />S lʼiman iy nfehhem qa ddunect-a ṯetwaxȓeq-d s wawaȓ n Arebbi iƹni min ḏayes netwaȓa war d ikki ca zi min d itbanen.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Habil iqeddem ijjen n dbiḥeṯ iy zi xas yarḍa Arebbi ḥsen zi ṯenni n <char style="it">wumas</char> Qabil. Ƹlaḥsab lʼiman-a itcekkar-iṯ Arebbi iqbeȓ-iṯ netta nican wami xas issiweȓ Arebbi mliḥ x min iqeddem. U <char style="it">nnabi</char> Habil s lʼiman nnes netta ƹaḏ issawaȓ waxxa immuṯ.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Axnux itwaxḍef ɣar ujenna ḥima war itwiȓi ca ȓmewṯ. War ṯ ufin ca, iysi-ṯ Arebbi ɣares. U qbeȓ ma aḏ itwaxḍef itwacekkar am yijjen yarḍa xas Arebbi.<verse eid="HEB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Iwa uȓa ḏ ijjen war izemmar axas yareṭṭa Arebbi bȓa lʼiman. Minzi wenni iy ɣa qarrben ɣar Arebbi labud aḏ yamen belli netta iǧa u ḏ netta ig itjazan yinni iy xas irezzun s wuȓawen nsen.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />S lʼiman <char style="it">nnabi</char> Nuḥ wami ḏas iƹȓem Arebbi x ṯmesȓayin nni war ṯent ẓrin yiwḏan ƹemmarṣ, ikkar netta s yijjen n ṯiggwḏi ḏ yijjen n ȓeḥya igga aɣarrabu bac aḏ isenjem ayṯbab n ṯeddarṯ nnes.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tuɣa Siḏna Nuḥ ḏ ijjen n bnaḏem nican netta ḏ ȓmumen waḥḏes jar yiwḏan n zman nnes, iggur nican ḏeg ubriḏ n Arebbi. Wami ixzar Arebbi ɣar ṯmurṯ yufi-t ṯƹemmar s ccarr ȓaḥeqqac iwḏan marra ffɣen abriḏ. Ikkar Arebbi inna-as i Siḏna Nuḥ qa yuweḍ-d ȓefna n marra n min iddaren ḏi ddunect-a ȓaḥeqqac iwḏan tmenɣan aṭṭas ḏi ṯmurṯ. Ƹlaḥsab manaya aṯen mḥiɣ niṯni ḏ ṯmurṯ. Egg i yixef nnec ij uɣarrabu ḏayes ṯȓaṯa n ṭṭebqaṯ icten x ṯenneɣni. Aqa nec aḏawem d ssekkeɣ ȓfayaḍan n waman x ṯmurṯ bac aḏ qḍiɣ x marra minḏi ig iǧa arruḥ ḏ marra min iǧan x ṯmurṯ aḏ immeṯ. Walakin cek akic ggeɣ ȓƹaheḏ, aḏ taḏfeḏ ḏeg uɣarrabu cek ḏ ṯarwa nnec ḏ ṯemɣarṯ nnec ḏ ṯemɣarin n ṯarwa nnec. Ikkar Siḏna Nuḥ igga marra s minzi ṯ iweṣṣa Siḏi Arebbi. </char></note> Wami igga manayenni netta iƹeyyeb ddunect, iwareṯ ṣṣulḥ nni iy d itasen s lʼiman.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Brahim iṭaƹ-as i Arebbi wami ḏas d iȓaɣa aḏ iraḥ ɣar yijjen n umcan iy ɣa iqbeȓ ḏ lwareṯ. Iffeɣ netta tuɣa war issin ca mani ɣa iraḥ. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />S lʼiman iruḥ netta izḏeɣ ḏi ṯmurṯ nni iy zi ṯ iwƹeḏ Arebbi, netta aqaṯ ḏinni am ca n ubarrani. Itƹic ḏeg iqiḍan akiḏes <char style="it">memmis</char> Isḥaq ḏ <char style="it">wayyaw nnes</char> Yaƹqub, twaraṯen akiḏes ƹlaḥsab min zi ṯen iwƹeḏ. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Ȓaḥeqqac Brahim itraja ṯandint nni ɣar ǧan dsasaṯ itduman, ixaṭṭ-it Arebbi ibna-t.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />S lʼiman Sara s yixef nnes immuc-as jjheḏ aḏ teysi aƹeddis waxxa nettaṯ ṯnumɣar, minzi ṯekkar nettaṯ ṯḥesseb wenni iy t iweƹḏen ḏayes ttiqeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ṯumma zi Brahim ḏ ijjen n uryaz iwsar ikemmeȓ, ijja-d ijjen n ddurriṯ am yiṯran iǧan ḏeg ujenna am yijḏi iǧan x cceṭṭ n ȓebḥar war izemmar ḥadd at iḥesseb.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Yina marra mmuṯen ḏi lʼiman nni nsen qbeȓ ma ḏasen d awḍent ṯmesȓayin nni iy zi ṯen iwƹeḏ. Walakin ẓrin-ṯent reḥḥben zzaysent zi ȓeggwaj, ƹtarfen belli niṯni ḏ ibarraniyen ḏ iƹezzaben ḏi ṯmurṯ-a. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Iwḏan iy ssawaȓen ammu iteḍhar-d belli rezzun x yijjen n ṯmurṯ aḏ tiȓi ḏ ṯamurṯ nsen. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Maƹlik tuɣa txemmamen ḏi ṯmurṯ nni manis d ffɣen, iȓi ɣarsen lfurṣa aḏ d ƹeqben. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Walakin lla, rezzun x yijjen n ṯmurṯ ḥsen zi ṯenni, iƹni icten ḏeg ujenna. X manayenni Arebbi war iseḏḥi ca aḏas inin qa cek ḏ Arebbi nneɣ minzi netta isewjeḏ-asen ijjen n ṯendint.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Brahim aḏ iqeddem ḏ dbiḥeṯ s <char style="it">memmis</char> Isḥaq wami ṯ ijarreb Arebbi. Iƹni tuɣa itqeddam ḏ dbiḥeṯ s memmis waḥḏes iy zi iwƹeḏ Arebbi Brahim, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />tuɣa inna-as qa s Isḥaq iy zi ɣa twaḥesseb ddurriṯ nnec. <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Iḥesseb Brahim belli izemmar Arebbi aḏ d isekkar mmis zeg imettinen. Manayenni ḏayes ȓemƹani minzi wah, memmis iḏweȓ-d i Brahim am yijjen zi ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Isḥaq ibarek <char style="it">ṯarwa nnes</char> Yaƹqub ḏ Ƹasu ƹlaḥsab lmustaqbel nsen.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Yaƹqub wami tuɣa itmetta ibarek ṯarwa <char style="it">n mmis</char> Yusef ij-ij, iƹebbeḏ netta xmi itsennaḏ x ṯeɣȓiyṯ nnes.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Yusef ɣar uneggaru n ṯuḏarṯ nnes, issiweȓ x wufuɣ n Ayṯ-Israʼil zi Miṣra iweṣṣa-aṯen aḏ ysin akiḏsen ixsan nnes.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />S lʼiman kkaren lwalidin n <char style="it">nnabi</char> Musa snuffaren memmiṯsen wami d ixȓeq minzi ẓrin belli netta iṣbaḥ aṭṭas, war ggwiḏen ca zi min ḏasen iweṣṣa uzeǧiḏ.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />S lʼiman ikkar <char style="it">nnabi</char> Musa wami imɣar yugi aḏas ȓaɣan memmis n yeǧis <char style="it">n lmalik</char> Firƹun. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Ixḍar axas buṣaren <char style="it">imiṣriyen</char> ak ccaƹb n Arebbi, war iqbiȓ ca aḏ ifareḥ ḏeg ufelles nni war itdumin ca. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Ifhem meȓa seḥqaren-ṯ ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ iƹni manayenni ɣares lqima ktar zi min ɣarsen ḏ lkunuz ḏi Miṣra. Aqa netta ixezzar ɣar zzaṯ ḏi ljaʼiza nnes.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />S lʼiman ikkar Musa iffeɣ zi Miṣra, war iggwiḏ ca zeg uɣḍab n uzeǧiḏ nni. Iṭṭef ḏi lʼiman nnes am yijjen itwaȓan <char style="it">Arebbi</char> netta war izemmar aṯ iẓer ḥadd. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />S lʼiman ikkar netta igga Ȓƹiḏ Ameqqran irucc ṯiwwura s iḏammen n ȓƹiḏ ḥima Ƹazȓayen war ineqq ca imenza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Imenza niṯni ḏ ifxeddan, qqaren-ṯ i iḥenjiren iy d ixeǧqen ḏ imezwura.</char></note> n Ayṯ-Israʼil.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />S lʼiman ikkar ccaƹb iẓwa ɣar ujemmaḍ-in n Ȓebḥar Azeggwaɣ s iḍaren nsen, ṯisi nnes ṯegga amecnaw ṯamurṯ yuzɣen. Walakin wami jarrben imiṣriyen aḏ ƹḏun ssenni infeyyeḍ-d xasen ȓebḥar ɣerqen.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />S lʼiman ikkar ccaƹb ȓexddenni wḍan ȓeḥyuḍ n ṯendint n Ariḥa wami ḏas inneḍ ccaƹb sebƹiyyam.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />S lʼiman ṯaḥenjirṯ nni umi qqaren Riḥab iy tuɣa iffɣen abrid, ṯekkar nettaṯ ṯreḥḥeb s lmuxabaraṯ <char style="it">n Ayṯ-Israʼil</char>. S manayenni war ṯemmuṯ ca ak yinni war itṭiƹin ca.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Iwa min ɣa iniɣ ƹaḏ? War ɣari bu ȓweqṯ aḏ ssiwȓeɣ x Jaƹḏun niɣ ḏ Barak niɣ ḏ Camcun niɣ ḏ Yafta niɣ ḏ <char style="it">nnabi</char> Dawed niɣ ḏ <char style="it">nnabi</char> Ṣamwil niɣ ḏ marra lʼanbiya. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />S lʼiman kkaren niṯni rebḥen lmemlakaṯ, ḥekmen s ȓḥaqq, ḥerṯen x lwuƹud, bellƹen iqemmumen n sbuƹaṯ, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />sexsin aḥaḏuq n ṯmessi, feȓṯen zi ȓeqḍeƹ n ssif. Ḍḍuƹef nsen iḏweȓ ḏ jjheḏ, jehḏen ḏi ȓḥarb uzzȓen x ȓƹaskar n ṯmura nneɣni. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Ȓebƹaḍ n ṯemɣarin ysint-id imettinen nsent iy d kkaren zi ȓmewṯ. Ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan marrṯen-ṯen, walakin niṯni ugin aḏ twaḍeȓqen bac aḏ rebḥen ijjen n lqiyama ḥsen. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Ȓebƹaḍ n yiwḏan ḥeggaren-ṯen, uwṯin-ṯen s usɣun, carfen-ṯen s snaseȓ, ḥebbsen-ṯen. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Rejmen-ṯen s uzru, qessen-ṯen x ṯnayen s ȓmencar, nɣin-ṯen s ssif. Gguren s yiȓemawen n iḥuȓiyen ḏ iɣayḏen. Niṯni ḏ imesƹan, twaƹeddaben, tenƹeddan xasen. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Niṯni ddunect-a war ṯen ṯesḏaheǧ ca. Tƹezzaben ḏi ȓexȓawaṯ ḏ iḏurar ḏ ixubac ḏ yifran n ṯmurṯ.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Marra yina twacekkaren s lʼiman nsen. Innama, uȓa ḏ ijjen zzaysen tuɣa <char style="it">ƹaḏ</char> war ḏas d yuwiḍ ca min zi ṯ iwƹeḏ <char style="it">Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Tuɣa Arebbi iḏebbar-aneɣ-d i neccin zi qbeȓ ijjen n ȓḥajeṯ ḥsen bac niṯni war tiwiḍen ca ɣar uneggaru iƹni aḏ iȓin kemȓen bȓa neccin.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Arebbi ḏ Babaṯneɣ u Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ zzaƹim nneɣ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Iḏen ƹlaḥsab niṯni, iƹni ȓechuḏ nni n lʼiman iy xaneɣ itennḍen am yijjen n umuni ḏ ameqqran, labud a nekkar a nekkes kuȓ dqeȓ ḏ kuȓ ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ iy ḏaneɣ iseḥṣaren. A nazzȓeṯ s ṣṣbar ṯazzȓa nni iy ḏaneɣ itrajan ɣar zzaṯ. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />U labud a nxezzar mliḥ ɣar Ƹisa zzaƹim nneɣ ḏ netta iy ḏaneɣ ɣa issiwḍen nican ɣar uneggaru. Ƹisa s ȓefraḥeṯ nni iy tuɣa ṯ itrajan ɣar zzaṯ, iṣbar x ṣṣalib iƹeyyeb aḥeggar n ṣṣalib nni ssenni iqqim x ufusi n ȓƹarc n Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Fekkareṯ mliḥ ḏi Ƹisa netta mecḥaȓ iṣbar x ccmayeṯ iy ḏas iƹarrḍen bac kenniw war tiḥȓem ca war tefciȓem ca.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Wami ṯmenɣem ḍed i ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, war ṯƹirrḍem ca bac aḏ azzȓen iḏammen nwem lla. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Kenniw ṯettum awaȓ nni <char style="it">zi Lkitab</char> iy kenniw ɣa icejjƹen, issawaȓen akiḏwem am ṯarwa nnes inna-awem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">&lt;A mmi, war tqehhar ca ttarbiya n Siḏi Arebbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:5">war tefciȓ ca meȓa netta inehha-cek.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Minzi Siḏi Arebbi itrebba wenni xas iƹizzen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HEB 12:6">inehha wenni iy xef yarḍa itwaḥsab am mmis.&gt;<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Ṣbareṯ x ttarbiya n Arebbi, itegg akiḏwem am ṯarwa nnes. Min iƹna mmis-a war ṯ itrebbi ca babas? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Yac marra iwḏan twarebban niɣ? Maƹlik kenniw war kenniw irebbi ca Arebbi, ataf kenniw am ṯarwa n ȓeḥram maci ḏ ṯarwa n lḥalal. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />U ƹaweḏ neccin marra tuɣa ɣarneɣ lwalidin ḏi ddunect-a iy ḏaneɣ itrebban netseḏḥa zzaysen. Iwa neccin meȓa a neddar, ataf a nseḏḥa zi Babaṯneɣ n ujenna ktar niɣ lla? <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Cuf, lwalidin trebban-aneɣ ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ, teggen mammec ḏasen itɣiȓ mliḥ. Walakin Arebbi itrebba-yaneɣ x nnfaƹ nneɣ bac a ncarec ḏi ṭṭabiƹa nnes iǧan ƹaḍim. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nnes kuȓ ttarbiyeṯ tɣiȓ-aneɣ ṯeqseḥ maci ḏ ṯaṣebḥant. Walakin menbaƹd aḏ tarew ijjen n ṯfeǧaḥṯ n ȓxir ḏ ijjen n ȓehna i yinni iy t ɣa iȓemḏen.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />X manaya sjehḏeṯ ifassen nwem irxun ḏ ifadden nwem ifecȓen. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Seggḏeṯ ibriḏen nwem nican bac iḍaren nwem izeḥḥafen war tɣimin ca ḏ ineƹḏam aḏ genfan.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abriḏ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Ggeṯ lmejhud bac aḏ tƹicem ḏi ȓehna ak marra iwḏan u bac aḏ tiȓim ṯeṣfam. Bȓa a niȓi neṣfa war ḏinni ḥadd iy ɣa iẓren Mawlana. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem bac war itɣimi ḥadd war ixeṭṭeȓ ɣar arḍa n Arebbi, niɣ ƹaweḏ war iɣemmi can n uẓwar ḏ amerzag aḏ igg lmacakil aḏ iḍeyyeƹ aṭṭas n yiwḏan. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" /><char style="it">Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem</char> bac war itegg can yijjen zzaywem lfasad, niɣ can yijjen war ɣares itiȓi bu Arebbi am Ƹasu nni iruḥ netta izzenz ȓḥaqq nnes zi lbaraka n babas x yijjen n ṭṭebsi n lmakla. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Aqa ṯessnem menbaƹd iƹqeb-d Ƹasu-ya irezzu aḏ iwareṯ lbaraka nni yugi-yas babas. War yufi mammec tid ɣa yarr waxxa itettar-as-t s imeṭṭawen.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Cuf, kenniw war ṯqarrbem ca ɣar yijjen n uḏrar iy ɣa tḥaḏam s ufus ḏayes ṯimessi ṯḥeddeq ḏayes ṯaǧest ḏayes ṯubarcant ḏayes arriḥ aṭṭas. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />Iteffeɣ-d zzayes ijjen n ṣṣut n zzammar ḏ yijjen n ṯmijja ṯessawaȓ awaȓen isaggwaḏen i yinni ḏas itsȓan, tettaren-teṯ war ḏasen ṯeqqar bu ca n wawaȓen nneɣni. <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />Minzi tuɣa niṯni war zemmaren ca aḏ ṣbaren i min ḏasen ṯweṣṣa ṯmijja nni, ṯenna-asen qa lḥayawan nni iy ɣa iḥaḏan aḏrar-a ataf u labud aḏ itwarjem s uzru. <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Min twaȓan ḏinni isaggwaḏ aṭṭas, ḥetta uȓa ḏ nnabi Musa inna aqayi terjijiɣ s ṯiggwḏi.<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Walakin kenniw ṯqarrbem-d ɣar Uḏrar n Ṣiyun iƹni ṯandint n Arebbi iddaren ḏ Lquds n ujenna, ḏayes aȓaf n uȓufaṯ n lmalaʼikaṯ. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" /><char style="it">Ṯqarrbem-d</char> ɣar yinni itmunen ḏi ȓefraḥeṯ iƹni ɣar jmaƹeṯ n yinni ixḍar Arebbi iy d ixeȓqen ḏ imezwura isemawen nsen twazemmen ḏeg ujenna. <char style="it">Ṯqarrbem-d</char> ɣar Arebbi wenni iǧan ḏ ȓqaḍi x marra iwḏan. <char style="it">Ṯqarrbem-d</char> ɣar arruḥaṯ n ṣṣaliḥin yarri-ṯen <char style="it">Arebbi</char> bȓa ȓƹib. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" /><char style="it">Ṯqarrbem-d</char> ɣar Ƹisa wenni itcafaƹen ḏayneɣ s yijjen n ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ. <char style="it">Ṯqarrbem-d kenniw</char> ɣar iḏammen nnes itwaruccen iy qqaren ijjen n wawaȓ ḥsen zeg wenni n nnabi Habil.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem war tjihiȓem ca awaȓ n wenni issawaȓen, mayemmi? Liʼanna Ayṯ-Israʼil war feȓṯen ca wami jehȓen awaȓ n wenni tuɣa ṯen iweṣṣan ḏi ṯmurṯ. U neccin ƹaḏ ktar, meȓa nugi a ntaƹ i wenni ḏaneɣ iweṣṣan zeg ujenna ataf ƹemmarṣ a nefȓeṯ. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ nni iƹḏun ṣṣut n Arebbi isenhezz ṯamurṯ, walakin ȓexxu iwƹeḏ inna qa ƹaḏ aḏ d tas ijjen n ȓweqṯ nec aḏ senhezzeɣ ṯamurṯ uȓa ḏ ijennaṯen. <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Awaȓ nni nnes iƹni &lt;ƹaḏ aḏ d tas ijjen n ȓweqṯ&gt; ataf netta issawaȓ x ca n ṯmesȓayin itenhezzan aḏ twakksent iƹni ḏ ṯimesȓayin nni iy d itwaxeȓqen bac ṯimesȓayin nni iy war itenhezzin ca ataf aḏ qqiment.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />X manaya a ncekkar Arebbi ȓaḥeqqac neqbeȓ ijjen n ȓmulk war itenhezzin ca. Ammu aḏas nqeddem i Arebbi ijjen n lƹibada s ȓuweqqar ḏ ṯiggwḏi axas yarḍa netta, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />minzi Arebbi nneɣ netta ḏ ijjen n ṯmessi isḥarraqen.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ȓuṣiyaṯ ṯineggura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Qqimeṯ tḥibbaṯ ayawya am wawmaṯen. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />War tettuṯ ca aḏ treḥḥbem zi midden minzi ȓebƹaḍ iy ggin manayenni treḥḥaben zi lmalaʼikaṯ bȓa ma ṯent ssnen. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Xemmmeṯ ḏeg imeḥbas amecnaw kenniw iy kiḏsen ṯetwaḥebbsem ḏ yinni iy xef tbuṣaren amecnaw kenniw ṯetwaƹeddabem.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Weqqareṯ ȓemȓac marra. Qama n ȓemȓac aḏ tiȓi s nniyyeṯ bȓa ȓɣedȓan. Aqa Arebbi aḏ iƹaqeb yinni ifessḏen ḏ yinni izennan. <verse eid="HEB 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Aḏ tƹicem bȓa ma aḏ tḥibbem tmenyaṯ, aḏ tqenƹem s min ɣarwem. Arebbi s yixef nnes inna qa ƹemmarṣ ac jjeɣ, ƹemmarṣ aḏayek semḥeɣ. <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />S manayenni neqqar s zƹameṯ qa nec Siḏi Arebbi itƹawan-ayi maci aḏ ggwḏeɣ. Min ḏayi ɣa igg bnaḏem?<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Ƹeqȓeṯ x yinni iy xawem itrayyan iƹni yinni issiwȓen akiḏwem s wawaȓ n Arebbi. Fekkareṯ ḏi min urwen niṯni s ṯuḏarṯ nsen, ggeṯ mammec iy ggin niṯni s lʼiman nsen. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netta ḏ ijjen, amecnaw iḍennaṭ amecnaw nhara amecnaw i ȓebda. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem bac war tḏeffarem ca lʼanwaƹ n useȓmeḏ feckel.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 13:9">Cuf, ḏ lemliḥ aḏ ijheḏ wuȓ nneɣ s arḍa maci s lmakla ddiniya, yinni iy t itetten war zzayes stenfiƹen ca. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Neccin ɣarneɣ ijjen n ȓmeḏbaḥ, zi ȓmeḏbaḥ-a war ɣarsen bu ȓḥaqq azzayes ccen yinni ixeddmen ḏeg Uqiḍun Ameqqran. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Liʼanna ȓefqi ameqqran itawi-d akiḏes iḏammen n lḥayawanaṯ ɣar Uxxam Amqeddes Aṭṭas amecnaw ijjen n ṣṣeḏqeṯ x ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ, walakin lḥayawanaṯ nni immuṯen sḥarraqen-ṯen ɣar ȓeggwaj n mani qqimen yiwḏan ḏeg iqiḍan nsen. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Ammu ƹaweḏ Ƹisa, ṯekka xas tamara nni ɣar ȓeggwaj n ṯewwarṯ n ṯendint bac aḏ issiṣfa ccaƹb s iḏammen nnes. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />X manaya a nraḥ ɣar <char style="it">Ƹisa</char> ɣar ȓeggwaj n iqiḍan a narbu aḥeggar nni iy xef iṣbar netta. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Minzi ḏanita war ɣarneɣ bu ṯendint itduman; Lla, nrezzu x ṯendint nni iy d ɣa yasen.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Iḏen labud s Ƹisa iy zi ɣa neḥmeḏ Arebbi ḏi mkuȓ ȓweqṯ. Ḏ ṯanita ḏ dbiḥeṯ iy ɣa nqeddem i Arebbi, iƹni meȓa neƹtaref s yisem nnes. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />U war tettuṯ ca aḏ teggem ȓxir aḏ tcarcem ak inneɣni minzi s dbiḥaṯ-a am ṯina iy ḏas iteƹjiben i Arebbi. <verse eid="HEB 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Ṭaƹeṯ i yinni xawem itrayyan, ggem-asen array minzi ḏ yinni ig iḥeṭṭan ȓaƹmar nwem. Aḏ ucen niṯni ȓeḥsab x manaya i Arebbi. Ṭaƹeṯ i yina bac ȓxeḏmeṯ nsen azzayes farḥen war xasen tbessiȓ ca. Meȓa ṯeggim ṯaɣennant ataf war kenniw ineffeƹ walu.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Ttareṯ i Arebbi xaneɣ. Aqa neccin metʼakeddin ḍḍamir nneɣ mertaḥ, nrezzu a nexḏem s ȓeḥya marra ṯimesȓayin. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Tettareɣ-awem s wuȓ inu xaṣṣatan aḏ teẓẓaǧem bac ḏeɣya aɣarwem d ḏewȓeɣ.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Arebbi ḏayes ȓehna, ḏ netta iy d yarrin Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa zeg imettinen s iḏammen n ȓƹaheḏ ig itduman i ȓebda, Ƹisa-ya ḏ Ameksa Ameqqran n iḥuȓiyen. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Aḏawem iḏebbar Arebbi marra ṯimesȓayin ṯiṣebḥanin bac aḏ teggem ȓxaḍar nnes. Aḏayneɣ ixḏem min ḏas iteƹjiben zzaṯes, s Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iy ɣar ɣa ṯiȓi lƹaḍama i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Fa ay ayṯma tettareɣ-awem aḏ teṣbarem i wawaȓ inu iy zi kenniw tweṣṣiɣ minzi uriɣ-awem-d ɣir ijjen n ṯebrat ḏ ṯamezyant. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Itxeṣṣa aḏ tessnem belli ḍeȓqen-as-d i wumaṯneɣ Timutawus. Akenniw ẓreɣ akiḏes iƹni meȓa yusa-d ḏeɣya. <verse eid="HEB 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Siwḍem-asen sȓam i marra yinni iy xawem itrayyan ḏ marra ṣṣaliḥin. Yina zi Iṭalya sawwaḍen-awem-d sȓam. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa marra iḏwem.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>